  "title": "ACM Research to Release Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results on August 7, 2026",
  "summary": "FREMONT, Calif., July 15, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ACM Research, Inc. (“ACM”) (NASDAQ: ACMR) announced today that it will release its financial results for the second quarter of 2026 before the U.S. market open on Friday, August 7, 2026. ACM will conduct a corresponding conference call at 8:00 a.m.",
